# Two input arms (sites 1 to 5 and 6 to 10) meet at site 11; the output arm runs from 11 to 16. The same two pulses with opposite phase cancel at the junction: the gate is interferometric.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Weak junction, both inputs in antiphase
sites 16
path 1 5 kappa=0.06
path 6 10 kappa=0.06
path 11 16 kappa=0.06
link 5 11 kappa=0.03
link 10 11 kappa=0.03
kick 1 amplitude=2
kick 6 amplitude=2 phase=180
run 1200
expect total 10
expect last 81.57065 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 12.96038 0.003
expect peak 1 58.059000 2e-4
expect count 3 1
expect arrival 3 48.19706 0.003
expect peak 3 56.713883 2e-4
